.TH VIMGUIDE 1 "2026" "vimguide 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
vimguide \- interactive full-screen reference for Vim/Vi commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vimguide
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B vimguide
is a lightweight, dependency-free terminal application that displays a
browsable, tabbed table of Vim/Vi commands grouped by mode: Movement,
Editing, Yank/Paste, Search, Insert, Visual, Command-line, Replace,
Windows, and Macros.
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.TP
.B Tab / ] / l / Right
Next category tab
.TP
.B Shift-Tab / [ / h / Left
Previous category tab
.TP
.B j / Down, k / Up
Scroll one row down / up
.TP
.B Ctrl-F / PageDown, Ctrl-B / PageUp
Scroll one page down / up
.TP
.B g / Home, G / End
Jump to top / bottom of the current tab
.TP
.B /
Start a live search filter within the current tab
.TP
.B Esc
Clear the active search filter
.TP
.B q / Ctrl-C
Quit
.SH AUTHOR
Generated reference tool for learning Vim/Vi keybindings.
